# Reference captures are local diagnostic artifacts, not sources: recapture them with the scripts
# in `scripts/` plus `tools/bevy-text-reference` (see docs/visual-comparison.md and
# docs/text-reference.md). Nothing under this directory is imported by `src/` or `tests/`.
artifacts/
